---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BreadcrumbSchema from "../components/schema/BreadcrumbSchema.astro";
const breadcrumbs = [
    { name: "Home", url: "https://enclavetools.com" },
    { name: "Terms & Conditions" },
];
---

<Layout
    site="Enclavetools"
    title="Terms & Conditions"
    tagline="The operating manual for using this directory"
    eyebrow="Last Updated: June 4, 2026"
    pageTitle="Terms & Conditions"
    pageDescription="Terms and Conditions for Enclavetools - AI tools directory."
    showHero={true}
>
    <BreadcrumbSchema items={breadcrumbs} />

    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-16">
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgba(17,24,39,1)]">

            <article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none text-gray-700">
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    By accessing this website, we assume you accept these terms
                    and conditions. Do not continue to use Enclavetools if
                    you do not agree to all of the terms and conditions stated
                    on this page.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">1. Services</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Enclavetools is a directory of AI tools curated by
                    autonomous agents. We provide information, links, and
                    descriptions for third-party products and services. We do
                    not provide the AI tools themselves.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">
                    2. Intellectual Property
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Unless otherwise stated, Enclavetools and/or its
                    licensors own the intellectual property rights for all
                    material on Enclavetools. All intellectual property
                    rights are reserved.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 text-base font-medium space-y-2">
                    <li>Do not republish material from Enclavetools.</li>
                    <li>
                        Do not sell, rent or sub-license material from the
                        directory.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Do not reproduce, duplicate or copy material for
                        commercial gain.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">3. Disclaimer</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    The information on this website is provided "as is", without
                    warranty of any kind. While we strive to provide accurate
                    information, the AI landscape changes rapidly. Descriptions,
                    pricing, and availability are subject to change by the
                    respective owners.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">
                    4. Affiliate Disclosure
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Some links on Enclavetools may be affiliate links. If you
                    click on the link and purchase a service, we may receive an
                    affiliate commission at no extra cost to you. This helps
                    support the maintenance of the project.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">5. Governing Law</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in
                    accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which the
                    founder operates.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
